{
["gossip"] = "Select _\"I'm a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events.\"_ ||gossip 118141",
["guide"] = "LEVELING\\Classic (11-60)\\Bloodmyst Isle (14-20)",
["event"] = "GOSSIP_MINED",
["locale"] = "enUS",
["gossipIcon"] = 132053,
["time"] = 1780279964,
["stepgoals"] = "step\ntalk Captured Sunhawk Agent##17824\n|tip Inside the cage.\nSelect _\"I'm a prisoner, what does it look like? The draenei filth captured me as I exited the sun gate. They killed our portal controllers and destroyed the gate. The Sun King will be most displeased with this turn of events.\"_\nSelect _\"Ah yes, Sironas. I had nearly forgotten that Sironas was here. I served under Sironas back on Outland. I hadn't heard of this abomination, though; those damnable draenei captured me before I even fully materialized on this world.\"_\nSelect _\"Incredible. How did Sironas accomplish such a thing?\"_\nSelect _\"Sironas is an eredar... I mean, yes, obviously.\"_\nSelect _\"The Vector Coil is massive. I hope we have more than one abomination guarding the numerous weak points.\"_\nSelect _\"I did and you believed me. Thank you for the information, blood elf. You have helped us more than you could know.\"_\nRecover the Sunhawk Information |q 9756/1 |goto Bloodmyst Isle/0 54.41,54.28\n|only if Draenei",
["ver"] = "8.1.36466",
["file"] = " / ZygorGuidesViewerClassicTBCAnniv / Guides-TBC / Leveling / ZygorLevelingAllianceCLASSIC.lua:5401\n",
